========================================
DISPATCHARR v0.31.0 COMPLETE BUGFIX PATCH
========================================

This patch includes FOUR critical bugfixes for v0.31.0:

1. ✅ Multi-Profile Failover Fix (url_utils.py)
2. ✅ Manual Stream Switch - No Cooldown (manager.py)
3. ✅ Manual Stream Switch - Profile ID Update (manager.py)
4. ✅ Manual Stream Switch - Respects User Choice (manager.py)

All four fixes work together seamlessly to restore proper failover behavior.

========================================
SUMMARY OF FIXES
========================================

FIX 1: MULTI-PROFILE FAILOVER
------------------------------
Problem: Only 1 profile per provider tried during auto-failover
Root Cause: order_alternates_from_current() used dict that overwrites multiple profiles
Solution: Changed to list-based grouping to preserve ALL profiles per stream
File: apps/proxy/live_proxy/url_utils.py

FIX 2: MANUAL STREAM SWITCH - NO COOLDOWN
------------------------------------------
Problem: Manual stream switches set cooldown on previous stream
Root Cause: _close_connection() always set cooldown before flag was checked
Solution: Added _manual_switch flag and clear it AFTER closing connection
File: apps/proxy/live_proxy/input/manager.py

FIX 3: MANUAL STREAM SWITCH - PROFILE ID UPDATE
------------------------------------------------
Problem: current_profile_id not updated in change_stream_url()
Root Cause: Profile ID only updated in _try_next_stream(), not in manual switch
Solution: Update current_profile_id in change_stream_url()
File: apps/proxy/live_proxy/input/manager.py

FIX 4: MANUAL STREAM SWITCH - RESPECTS USER CHOICE
---------------------------------------------------
Problem: User selects Stream X, but gets Stream Y if X is on cooldown
Root Cause: Auto-failover skips cooled streams even after manual selection
Solution: Added _manual_switch_retry flag to skip cooldown check for user's chosen stream
File: apps/proxy/live_proxy/input/manager.py

========================================
APPLY WITH
========================================

patch -p0 < dispatcharr_v0.31.0_COMPLETE_BUGFIX.patch

Or manually apply changes to files listed below.

